      "content": "idk im just busy right now and cant get to a doctor until tomorrow/monday. my sugar readings have been a bit high but nothing crazy like 250 or 300, usually just like 180-210. if i just drink a ton of water and maybe take an extra dose of my metformin to bring it down, do u think that would fix the thirst thing? i dont wanna go to the er if its just the supplements.",
