      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get the warning but im just really worried about the supplement causing a reaction. if i take like 2 extra metformin pills tonight it should help clear out the extra sugar and the thirst should go away by morning right? i feel fine otherwise just really thirsty and peeing a lot. seems like nothing major.",
